sequenceDiagram
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    %% PART 1 — Registration
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    participant CA as Client App
    participant TS as Tournament Server

    Note over CA, TS: Registration Phase

    CA ->> TS: Request available tournaments
    TS -->> CA: List of open tournaments

    Note over CA: Discovers own IP and port on startup
    CA ->> TS: Register (name, ip, port)
    TS ->> TS: Create remote participant slot
    TS -->> CA: Registration confirmed

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    %% PART 2 — Tournament Execution
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    participant Admin as Admin
    participant GE as Game Engine
    participant RP as Remote Participant
    participant Obs as Observers

    Note over Admin, Obs: Tournament Execution Phase

    Admin ->> TS: Start tournament
    TS ->> GE: Run all pairs

    loop Each pair of participants
        GE ->> RP: Reset before match
        RP ->> CA: Forward reset
        CA -->> RP: OK

        loop Each round
            GE ->> RP: Request action (game history)
            RP ->> CA: Send history, ask for action
            CA ->> CA: Local participant decides
            CA -->> RP: Return action label
            RP -->> GE: Return concrete action
            GE ->> GE: Compute payoff
            GE ->> Obs: Notify move made
        end

        GE ->> Obs: Notify game over
    end

    GE ->> Obs: Notify tournament over
    GE -->> TS: Tournament result
    TS -->> Admin: Return results
